<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian oils market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian oils market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian oils market was closed on Thursday due to a public holiday to observe the birth of the Prophet Muhammad.</p>
<p>Traders said palm olein was quoted at 1,380 rupiah/kg in Jakarta on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Normal trading resumes on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
